<title>USA: Pioneer Railcorp completes bridge work.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Railcorp completes bridge work.</headline>
<dateline>PEORIA, Ill. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pioneer Railcorp said its wholly owned Alabama &amp; Florida Railway Co subsidiary completed repairs and strengthened several railroad bridges and trestles between Georgiana and Samson, Ala.</p>
<p>The work, started in 1995, cost more than $500,000.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
